{"ID":"20240118151225-5i0ll7i","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151225-5i0ll7i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151225-5i0ll7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151225-p8mu93u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113511-9rnrjht\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113511-9rnrjht\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:207,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:207\u0026#125;","title":"127海蛤","type":"doc","updated":"20240130145212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151225-p8mu93u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151225-p8mu93u","updated":"20240122113455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主咳逆上气、喘息烦满，胸痛寒热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113457-rejzrwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113457-rejzrwl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产海滨，为蛤类之壳，经海水漂集海边泥沙中者，细小如棋子，光润莹净。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113458-grhf746","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113458-grhf746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦咸．性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113500-wmaijyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113500-wmaijyf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】海蛤粉为软坚润下要药，主老痰，热痰，痰气喘咳，消瘿核，散肿毒，止呕逆，利小便，治妇人血病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113502-75s6xaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113502-75s6xaj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】主热痰湿痰老痰顽痰，疝气，白浊带下，香附末姜汁调服，主心痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113504-rpvukbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113504-rpvukbi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113505-terwbxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113505-terwbxm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】畏甘遂芫花，虽善消痰积血块，然脾胃虚寒者宜少用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113506-zo0jdo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113506-zo0jdo7"}},{"ID":"20240122113506-pbfzhp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113506-pbfzhp7"}},{"ID":"20240122113506-azd5vxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113506-azd5vxz","updated":"20240130145101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个蛤蜊呢？海蛤，我就住在海蛤上面。我们佛罗里达整个都是海蛤……造成那个州啊，看有多少？泥土里面挖挖出来，统统是，前面再一挖，下面就是，统统都是海蛤，这个海蛤是非常多的。常在海边，那这个光润好鲜亮的。那海蛤呢，一样是软坚润下的药，消瘿核，海蛤跟牡蛎，你看那样子，都是那个蛤蜊的外壳，它本身药效差不多，那你在临床上看的时候，你看哪一个取得最方便，比如说牡蛎取得方便你就拿牡蛎嘛，海蛤取得方便你就拿海蛤，不要说很固定一定要取那个，你看取哪个方便。那我们做医生的能够尽量把这个药能够便宜化普遍化最好，俯拾可得是最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113511-9rnrjht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113511-9rnrjht","updated":"20240130145212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个药呢，它是……那你看哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"朱丹溪他就称赞海蛤到什么程度，他说只要是痰，热痰、湿痰、老痰、顽痰，什么样的痰都给你去掉，为什么？咸能软坚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那能够消瘿核，消瘿核，就是甲状腺肿瘤。这个药是苦咸的味道，性平无毒，这种药随时都可以用。你要吃到金石类的药，或者是蛤蜊，这种蛤蜊的壳，牡蛎的壳，当你打粉的时候，要打得很细。非常细。那用筛子筛，打得很细，要不到胃里很难过哦。如果打得不细，病人吃下去，不是没有效，而是吃了胃很难过，沙子堵在肚子里面似的。所以打粉打细一点，没关系。"}]}]}